F src/services/booking-service.ts 62f1c5bb887a 2026-09-30 lab/claude BookingService: use cases for booking lifecycle (request, confirm, cancel, complete). Each method loads the booking, transitions through transition(), saves, and records the event. Depends on: BookingRepository, CustomerRepository, SlotRepository, EventLog, Clock. Callers: HTTP handlers (api/http.ts), App composition root. Must keep true: every status change goes through transition() (G:status.transition); every amount (price, fee) in events for downstream billing/reports (G:events.every-change); percentOf always used for percentages, never Math.round (G:money.half-even); cancellation fees: 10% of price if confirmed booking cancelled < 24h before slot start, zero if staff customer or booking not confirmed (d-0004 ops agreement).
