F src/ports/discount-repository.ts 531fb31a16b0 2026-09-30 lab/claude DiscountRepository port: interface for discount code lookup and storage. DiscountCode has code: string and percent: number. get(code) returns the DiscountCode or undefined; save(discount) stores it. Services depend on this port, never on adapters (G:services.ports). Callers: BookingService for applyDiscount method.
