F src/api/http.ts 4894320ea392 2026-09-30 lab/claude HTTP request router mapping POST/GET paths to BookingService, CustomerService, SlotService, ReportService use cases. Implements C:client-contract: error shape is { error: { code, message } } with DomainError code verbatim; cancel returns 202 Accepted because refunds settle asynchronously. Routes: POST /customers (201), /slots (201), /bookings (201), /bookings/:id/confirm (200), /bookings/:id/cancel (202); GET /bookings/:id (200), /reports/revenue (200). Handler catches DomainError and translates via errorResponse() using STATUS map. Depends on: BookingService, CustomerService, SlotService, ReportService, DomainError. Callers: app.ts composition root. Must keep true: error shape (d-0003, G:api.error-shape); cancel status 202 (d-0008).
